    {
      "id": "progression.asset.d2efc566089b6d1df263",
      "source": "An infamous creature with the ability to transform its appearance to look like any other human. It likes to use its shapeshifting abilities to blend in and deceive enemies.",
      "translation": "声名狼藉的生物，能变成任何人的模样。它善用变形能力混入人群，欺骗敌人。",
