    {
      "id": "progression.asset.b12e1668ea7e6acaf852",
      "source": "A proud knight in plate armor who trained all life long to become a master of all weapons.",
      "translation": "身披板甲的骄傲骑士，终其一生磨炼技艺，志在精通所有武器。",
