    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.6bb7bc7b66e5bb0138ac",
      "source": "A mysterious and nimble duelist who uses elemental magic to strike with speed and precision.",
      "translation": "神秘而灵巧的决斗者，运用元素魔法迅速而精准地出击。",
