      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55910"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.438ef446e5b57779fec2",
      "source": "A sage that has mastered the art of fire, burning any and all who dare cross their path.",
      "translation": "精通火焰之道的贤者，将所有胆敢阻挡其脚步的人烧成灰烬。",
