      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55911"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.582e8f26cb00e753e7ad",
      "source": "A nimble ranger that favours to take down enemies from range.",
      "translation": "灵巧的游侠，偏爱从远处击倒敌人。",
