    {
      "id": "progression.asset.7ce819653dc6a458c9ff",
      "source": "A hot blooded young hero on a quest to vanquish humanity's\nbiggest adversary. \nCan they defeat Death?\n",
      "translation": "热血的年轻勇者，立志击败人类\n最强大的敌人。 \n他们能战胜死神吗？\n",
      "context": "*",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55916"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.115f987c5980f5091598",
