      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55973"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.6fb942fc126df30ad916",
      "source": "A fierce warrior who channels primal rage into devastating blows. They thrive in the chaos of close combat, overpowering foes with brute strength.",
      "translation": "凶猛的战士，将原始怒火化为毁灭性的重击。他们在混乱的近身战中如鱼得水，用蛮力压倒敌人。",
      "context": "*",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55973"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.9f522548645b30102607",
