      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55974"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.5387d9809da848c1b461",
      "source": "A being born from the heart of disorder. In their wake, reality shifts, weaving the unpredictable forces of the universe into an arsenal as random as fate itself.",
      "translation": "生于无序中心的存在。他们经过之处，现实随之扭曲，将宇宙中不可预测的力量织成如命运般随机的武装。",
      "context": "*",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原版英文独立翻译；Player.PlayerClass / resources.assets / 55974"
    },
    {
      "id": "progression.asset.9479a4730cb8901bfb56",
